   $q$Listen. Obi and Mom were playing catch in the driveway. Obi threw the ball too high, and it bounced up onto the garage roof. It rolled into the gutter and stayed there. Obi jumped and jumped but could not reach it. So Obi asked Mom for help. Mom carried a tall ladder from the shed, climbed up and tossed the ball back down. What helped get the ball down? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"wagon","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"wagon","count":1}},{"text":"umbrella","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"umbrella","count":1}},{"text":"ladder","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"ladder","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$ladder$q$, $q$The ball was stuck on the garage roof, so Mom climbed a tall ladder and tossed it back down.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
