   $q$Listen. Gemma wanted to ride a bike with no training wheels. On the first day, Gemma wobbled and fell in the grass. On the second day, Gemma wobbled and fell again. Gemma did not quit. Gemma kept trying every single day. On the fifth day, Gemma pedaled all the way down the sidewalk without falling! Gemma cheered and grinned from ear to ear. How did Gemma feel at the end of the story? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"scared","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_scared","count":1}},{"text":"sad","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_sad","count":1}},{"text":"happy","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$happy$q$, $q$At the end, Gemma rode all the way down the sidewalk, cheered and grinned. Gemma felt happy after all that hard work.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
