   $q$Listen. Wes was painting a picture for the class art show. Just as Wes finished, a big blob of yellow paint dripped onto the page. Oh no, said Wes. Wes thought about starting over. Then Wes had an idea. Wes added yellow petals all around the blob and painted a green stem below it. The blob became a bright, sunny flower. What did Wes do about the paint blob? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"hid the picture","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"hid the picture"}},{"text":"threw it away","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"threw it away"}},{"text":"made it a flower","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"made it a flower"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$made it a flower$q$, $q$Wes added petals and a stem around the yellow blob. Wes turned the mistake into a sunny flower.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
