   $q$Listen. Rafi's best friend, Toby, moved to a new town far away. The first week, Rafi felt lonely at recess and missed playing tag with Toby. One afternoon, Rafi sat down with paper and markers. Rafi wrote a long letter about school and drew a picture of the two friends playing tag. Rafi mailed it the next day and felt a little better. What did Rafi do to feel better? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"wrote a letter","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"wrote a letter"}},{"text":"broke a toy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"broke a toy"}},{"text":"stayed in bed","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"stayed in bed"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$wrote a letter$q$, $q$Rafi missed Toby, so Rafi wrote a long letter and drew a picture. Mailing the letter helped Rafi feel a little better.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
