   $q$Listen. Paz woke up early, before the sun was up. Today the family was going to the lake! Paz packed a towel, a snack and a sand shovel. In the car, Paz sang songs the whole way. At the lake, Paz splashed, dug in the sand and found a smooth white rock. At the end of the day, Paz fell asleep in the car holding the rock. What happens at the beginning of the story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Paz wakes up early","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Paz wakes up early"}},{"text":"Paz finds a rock","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Paz finds a rock"}},{"text":"Paz falls asleep","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Paz falls asleep"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Paz wakes up early$q$, $q$The beginning tells who the story is about and what is starting: Paz wakes up early for a trip to the lake. Finding the rock happens in the middle, and falling asleep is the ending.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
