   $q$Listen. All week, Tobin counted the days until the class trip to the zoo. On Friday morning, a big storm rolled in, and the teacher said the trip had to wait. Tobin frowned, crossed both arms and stomped back to the desk. It is not fair, Tobin grumbled. Later, the teacher said they would go next Friday, and Tobin felt a little better. How did Tobin feel when the trip had to wait? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"mad","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_mad","count":1}},{"text":"tired","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_tired","count":1}},{"text":"happy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$mad$q$, $q$Tobin frowned, crossed both arms, stomped and grumbled that it was not fair. Those clues tell us Tobin felt mad.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
