   $q$Listen. Kenna grew a little bean plant in a clay pot by the kitchen window. One Monday, Kenna saw that the leaves were droopy and the dirt was dry and hard. Kenna knew the plant was thirsty. Kenna filled a cup with water and poured it slowly into the pot. The next morning, the plant stood up tall and green again. What did Kenna use to help the droopy plant? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"crayon","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"crayon","count":1}},{"text":"comb","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"comb","count":1}},{"text":"cup","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"cup","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$cup$q$, $q$The dirt was dry, so Kenna filled a cup with water and poured it into the pot. The next morning, the plant stood tall again.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
