   $q$Listen. Lior could not find Pepper, the family cat. Lior looked in the kitchen, in the closet and behind the couch. Lior looked in the yard and called, Here, Pepper! But Pepper did not come. Lior began to worry. Then Lior heard a soft meow from upstairs. Under the bed, curled up on an old sweater, was Pepper. Lior hugged the cat close. How does the story end? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Lior gets a dog","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Lior gets a dog"}},{"text":"Pepper runs away","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Pepper runs away"}},{"text":"Lior finds Pepper","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Lior finds Pepper"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Lior finds Pepper$q$, $q$At the end, Lior hears a meow and finds Pepper under the bed. The ending solves the problem of the missing cat.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
